<title>TAIWAN: Yuen Foong Yu posts Jan-Sept loss.</title>
<headline>Yuen Foong Yu posts Jan-Sept loss.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				13,309 vs 15,418</p>
<p>    Pretax loss/profit		 loss 95 vs  1,150</p>
<p>    Net loss/profit		   loss 101 vs  1,127</p>
<p>NOTE - Yuen Foong Yu Paper Manufacturing Co is Taiwan's leading paper maker.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
